{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "(Guess Shibata-san's daughter is hearing wedding bells by now. I'm glad Shibata-san decided to open up a bit.)": "",
  "(And of all things, Shibata-san invited me to his daughter's wedding. I'm happy, but... wouldn't it be weird if I went?)": "",
  "(Looks like Shibata-san's daughter had a wonderful wedding. He said he cried the whole time... Guy's got a soft heart.)": "",
  "(But did Shibata-san really have to say I should get married too? Sheesh... I guess he has a point, though.)": "",
  "(Shibata-san fed me a pork cutlet bowl today... Was he trying to win me over like in one of those police dramas?)": "",
  "(Looks like Shibata-san's back to yelling at me. Said I should be acting my age... I've got nothing to say to that.)": "",
  "(Shibata-san rambled on about his \"heroic exploits\" today... Can't believe how many times I almost nodded off.)": "",
  "There you are, Yagami! Today's the day I smear you into the pavement once and for all!": "",
  "Get ready to eat some street, fuckface!": "",
  "Ah, there's the man I've been looking for... So Koga, being the lazy motherfucker that he is, asked me to kick your ass.": "",
  "But, regardless of the reason, I'd be happy to fight you either way. ": "",
  "Heh. I could go on like this forever... but why don't we catch up with our fists instead!?": "",
  "Hoo-hoo, found you, Yagami! They said if I squash you into the ground, they'll give me a nice big reward.": "",
  "Nothing personal, but I'm gonna have to mince you into tiny little pieces now. And after that...": "",
  "IT'S CHOW TIIIIIME!!!": "",
  "Well, look who it is. I've been looking everywhere for you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Thanks to you making a mockery of us, we've lost the reputation we struggled so hard to gain...": "",
  "I realized you've been nothing but a thorn in our side from day one... and you're going to pay for that with your life!": "",
  "(Hm? Who's this from?)": "",
  "(Crap, what do I do...)": "",
  "(Whew, that settles it for now... I think?)": "",
  "(Ngh... Dammit!)": "",
  "(That detective, what's-his-name... Shibata? He really wouldn't shut the heck up.)": "",
  "Welcome.": "",
  "You, bad! Go outside!": "",
  "I can't let you do this! Don't come back!": "",
  "You're like a hurricane... Don't come back!": "",
  "Get out!": "",
  "Wh-What am I supposed to do now? Please see yourself out this instant!": "",
  "How could you do that...? Please stay away from here!": "",
  "Get out of here! And don't you dare come back!": "",
  "Get out of here right now!": "",
  "Oh, hi there. Enjoy.": "",
  "Oh, leaving already? Come back soon.": "",
  "Welcome, welcome! Can I take your order?": "",
  "Thank you very much! Come back again!": "",
  "Welcome!": "",
  "Get out! Please leave!": "",
  "What have you done...? Leave, and don't come back!": "",
  "Get out! Never come back!": "",
  "Please leave!": "",
  "How could you do that...? Please stay away!": "",
  "Get out! And don't ever come back!": "",
  "(Hm... I don't really have anything to sell. Guess not...)": "",
  "Hello. Welcome to Smile Burger, home of the free smile!": "",
  "Thank you very much. We look forward to seeing you again soon.": "",
  "Welcome. Can I get you a drink? They're all free.": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san. Want me to make some extracts? I'll sell you whatever I make.": "",
  "Come back again later.": "",
  "(Oh, hey, a capsule machine. That takes me back...)": "",
  "(\"Decor-oceans\" Series 1. 300 yen a spin. Should I buy one?)": "",
  "(\"Decor-oceans\" Series 2. 300 yen a spin. Should I buy one?)": "",
  "(How am I this broke? Guess I'll come back later.)": "",
  "(Oh man, I couldn't even carry this right now. I gotta get organized...)": "",
  "(Another time, little toy.)": "",
  "Welcome, Yagami-san! How about a delicious beef bowl!?": "",
  "Here again, Yagami-san? Eat something!": "",
  "Thanks! Come again!": "",
  "Sir, please, just stop... Tell me your order.": "",
  "Welcome, sir. Are you ready to order?": "",
  "Thanks for coming in time and again. See you soon, we hope.": "",
  "Yagami-sama. Thank you for your visit. Can I take your order?": "",
  "Welcome, Yagami-san! You hungry?": "",
  "Was that ruckus necessary? Just gimme your damn order!": "",
  "Now you've done it, Yagami-san! You know I have to clean this up, don't you!?": "",
  "You're pretty tough, Yagami-san! Got an appetite?": "",
  "Welcome! Thank you for your continued patronage!": "",
  "W-Welcome.": "",
  "I have to clean this up, so why don't you head home?": "",
  "I have to clean up, so can you make this quick?": "",
  "Welcome, sir! Always a pleasure to have you.": "",
  "I'm sorry, I can't help you right now. Come back later.": "",
  "Welcome. Please don't break everything, all right?": "",
  "It's a pleasure to see you again, sir!": "",
  "Buy what you need and leave!": "",
  "As you can see, I have to clean up. Come back soon.": "",
  "Welcome. Please don't cause a scene, okay?": "",
  "Welcome. Thank you for your continued patronage.": "",
  "Japan is too dangerous! I'm scared! Buy stuff and go home!": "",
  "Oh! I have to clean up, so come later!": "",
  "Oh! Karate boy! Welcome!": "",
  "W-W-Welcome to Smile Burger...": "",
  "Welcome, sir! My name is Hanae Ida, and I'm coming at you with another smile sale!": "",
  "Eek! W-Welcome...": "",
  "Sir... Will you be getting anything? Y-Your order please?": "",
  "Yagami-san! I owe you one, man! What can I get you today?": "",
  "You're kind of a problem, sir... What will you be getting?": "",
  "I like you Yagami-san, but this has gone far enough. I think you oughta head home.": "",
  "Not here to break the store, right? If not, can I help you?": "",
  "Welcome, Yagami-sama. What would you like today?": "",
  "Thank you for coming in.": "",
  "Welcome, Yagami-san. What can I get for you?": "",
  "Welcome, sir. What would you like to order today?": "",
  "Thank you for your continued patronage. Please come again.": "",
  "W-Welcome...!": "",
  "Why would you do this to me, Yagami-san? Please come back after we repair this...": "",
  "Don't get crazy again, Yagami-san. What can I get you?": "",
  "Yagami-san! Thank you for stopping in!": "",
  "Thank you for coming!": "",
  "U-Umm... W-Welcome.": "",
  "Yagami-san, what in the world!? Come on! Get outta here!": "",
  "Don't do anything dangerous, okay, Yagami-san? What can I get you?": "",
  "You're causing a scene! Just give me your order!": "",
  "Yagami, what are you doing!? Go home!": "",
  "Lookin' good, Yagami! Eat something!": "",
  "(Rei Miyamoto... Is that her?)": "",
  "Um... Are you Yagami-san, by any chance?": "",
  "Yes, Ma'am. That would make you Rei Miyamoto, I presume?": "",
  "Yes. Thanks for coming, Yagami-san.": "",
  "I understand you have a job for me. Care to tell me a little more?": "",
  "According to what I saw at Tender, you're looking to get some evidence of sexual harassment?": "",
  "Yes, I'm afraid so. I can't tell you how stressed out I've been about it...": "",
  "If it's making your workplace feel like a battleground, I can only imagine.": "",
  "Exactly. I've been at kind of a loss about how to handle this...": "",
  "Our HR department offers official assistance, but I know they won't do anything without evidence.": "",
  "I was complaining about it at Tender, and the barkeep recommended I talk to you.": "",
  "Well, I'm happy to help if I can.": "",
  "Why don't you tell me a little about this boss who's harassing you? ": "",
  "His name is Taro Iseya.": "",
  "Uh, what's up with the crazy headband?": "",
  "Yeah... He likes to think of that and his necktie as trademarks of his personality or something.": "",
  "Sounds like a strange guy. Is it mostly verbal harassment, or does he touch you too?": "",
  "It's both... He'll say stuff like, \"Oh, you must be so stiff,\" and then he goes in for a shoulder massage. It's gross.": "",
  "Hm. Pretty inappropriate.": "",
  "And I don't know if it was intentional or not, but he's touched my rear as he passed by before...": "",
  "I see. It's a pretty common tactic of those types to try to make it seem like an accident.": "",
  "Yeah... But there's another thing that kind of complicates this...": "",
  "Iseya-san is actually the son of our CEO.": "",
  "Yeah, I read that in your request. I won't lie, that does make things more complicated.": "",
  "Right. You'd want the company to believe you, but when it's the CEO's son, who knows how they'd handle an accusation?": "",
  "Well, I think I have an understanding of what you need now. And it all starts with evidence.": "",
  "The best way to handle this is probably to sneak into the office.": "",
  "Oh, a stealth mission!? This is practically out of a movie!": "",
  "In that case, head to \"Isetani Trading Co.\" It's on the fourth floor above the Nyan Nyan Cat Café on Senryo Avenue.": "",
  "(Got it. Isetani Trading Company, fourth floor of a building on Senryo Avenue.)": "",
  "(Hm. A janitor, eh? I bet I could get in without raising too many eyebrows in that uniform...)": "",
  "(Just have to get ahold of the uniform...)": "",
  "Um, hi. I'm Yagami, the new janitorial hire. I was told to report to you?": "",
  "Hm? Nobody told me anything about getting a new guy today. You sure you heard right?": "",
  "Yes, sir. HR finished my paperwork and said I should go introduce myself and get started.": "",
  "That so? Well, if it means I get to do half the work today, I'm not complaining! This your first cleaning job?": "",
  "Nope. I used to clean a smaller office. I should be fine.": "",
  "Good, good. Let's get started then, yeah?": "",
  "Sure! My pleasure, sir.": "",
  "Why don't you start with garbage collection, then?": "",
  "Oh, Rei!": "",
  "(We can't act like we know each other...)": "",
  "Hello, Ma'am.": "",
  "Is it cleaning time already? Thanks for the hard work as usual, guys.": "",
  "Aw, thanks, Rei-chan. You're looking sharp as ever today. Heh.": "",
  "Hm? You know the workers in the office, senpai?": "",
  "Yeah, when you clean every day, you get to know people. It's important to make sure they notice you, y'know?": "",
  "I see. Never thought of it that way.": "",
  "Hey you two, don't let the boss see you slacking!": "",
  "True, true. All right newbie, I'll handle bathrooms.": "",
  "Are you actually here undercover, Yagami-san? I didn't know that was even a thing you detectives still did!": "",
  "Shhh. Lower your voice, or you'll draw attention.": "",
  "Ohhh, right. Sorry, this is all kinds of exciting!": "",
  "Yagami-san, keep an eye on me, but even if I get harassed, you have to focus on getting the evidence.": "",
  "I can endure what I have to if it means cornering Iseya!": "",
  "Sure. That's brave of you. But let's make sure this is the last day you have to suffer through this.": "",
  "Yeah. Thank you.": "",
  "(All right, time to do what I came here for.)": "",
  "(First I've gotta find Iseya...)": "",
  "(Oh, that must be him.)": "",
  "Come on, you lot! Let's see some smiling faces and some steps with pep! Feel the waves of my positive energy!": "",
  "Woooooosh! Woooooosh! Do you feel the vibes I'm sending you? Keep it positive, keep it productive!": "",
  "(The only thing he's making me feel is nauseous...)": "",
  "(Let's see... What's the best way to go about this?)": "",
  "I have the documents you requested, Iseya-san.": "",
  "Wow! What a speed demon! You're 10 out of 10 as ever!": "",
  "Heh heh... Truly... a 10 out of 10...": "",
  "(It's one thing to look at your employees, it's another thing to leer...)": "",
  "(Miyamoto-san seems pretty uncomfortable back there.)": "",
  "(Better get a shot of this. While I'm in disguise...)": "",
  "(Unfortunately, this won't prove anything, though. I should stick around and see if this goes any further.)": "",
  "All righty, you lot! No lean, mean overtime machines! Go on home, you busy bees!": "",
  "Like the company motto says, \"Our employees are family!\" And I would <font_kind=yakuza_italic>never</font_kind> ask my family to put in OT!": "",
  "(Looks like the office is closing for the day...)": "",
  "Hm? Aren't you going home, Rei?": "",
  "Oh yes, eventually. I just have some urgent deadlines to meet. But don't worry, my OT is approved.": "",
  "Hm, is that so? Well, I don't want you pushing yourself too hard. I'd hate to have to worry about one of our stars.": "",
  "Oh there's no need to worry. The cramps in my shoulders should go away eventually...": "",
  "Ah...": "",
  "See, there we go! I'm flooding you with my waves of positivity! Energy to eradicate the pain!": "",
  "(Better get a shot of this.)": "",
  "Hey, what are you doing?": "",
  "Huh? Oh, nothing. Don't worry about it.": "",
  "Hey, you two! How long does it take to clean an office? Go home if you're done already!": "",
  "I-I'm sorry, sir.": "",
  "(That would mean Miyamoto-san and Iseya would be alone...)": "",
  "We better go, newbie. Trust me, you don't want that guy mad at you.": "",
  "(Not much choice here... But this is my last chance to get some solid evidence.)": "",
  "(They kicked me out, but now's my only chance.)": "",
  "(I wonder if I can get a look at what's going on inside somehow.)": "",
  "(Yeah, there we go.)": "",
  "(She seemed to notice the drone... She knows I'm the one flying it, right?)": "",
  "Huh!? Shit!": "",
  "(Huh? She... wants me to get the shot?)": "",
  "(Is she that bent on getting this evidence?)": "",
  "(I've gotta help her!)": "",
  "Miyamoto-san? Are you okay?": "",
  "Y-Yes. I pushed Iseya away and ran...": "",
  "But more importantly, did you get the shot!?": "",
  "Good... So you <font_kind=yakuza_italic>were</font_kind> controlling the drone, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san? Can I have the picture you took?": "",
  "Huh? Sure, but what do you plan on doing with it?": "",
  "I want to confront Iseya myself!": "",
  "Alone, Miyamoto-san!? You really think that's a good idea?": "",
  "Yeah. Now's the time to bring my A-game.": "",
  "As long as I have the evidence, Iseya is powerless!": "",
  "You're sure you don't want me to go with you?": "",
  "No. Let me do this alone!": "",
  "More than the harassment, what was really bothering me was my own lack of courage.": "",
  "And I'm tired of being that kind of person.": "",
  "I can understand that.": "",
  "Yagami-san, thank you for getting to the bottom of this. I'll wire you the money later!": "",
  "(She looked pretty pumped about that... But is she really going to be okay by herself?)": "",
  "(I can't shake being worried... Maybe I should see if I can find out what's going on in there.)": "",
  "(Huh!? What's going on!?)": "",
  "(Whoa! This is getting pretty out of hand.)": "",
  "(I can't let things go on like this. I've gotta get back up there.)": "",
  "I admit, you're a cautious man, Iseya-san. You're careful not to pull anything around anyone else.": "",
  "Wh-What do you mean to do with a picture like that?": "",
  "Well, it'd be quite a problem if an image like this got out to the public, wouldn't it?": "",
  "Times are changing, you know. The company would have no choice but to take action against you.": "",
  "B-But you're the one who initiated it! And we both know this isn't the first time! You even asked me to touch you!": "",
  "Hmm? You want to see how well that holds up in court? Your word against mine?": "",
  "Unless you can produce evidence Rei-chan was asking for it? You can't, can you!": "",
  "E-Evidence?": "",
  "On the other hand, she has all the evidence she needs. Evidence you assaulted poor, innocent Rei-chan.": "",
  "It's going to take more than positive energy to bury these photos, Iseya-san.": "",
  "If you don't want them to see the light of day, you better get the CEO to reconsider my transfer out of Tokyo!": "",
  "I-I-Is that a threat!? Y-You conniving... Why would you do this!?": "",
  "I don't want to go work in some dingy suburb! I want to keep living in Tokyo!": "",
  "O-Okay! I'll have a talk with my father!": "",
  "Good. And while you're at it, I want a raise! Fifty thousand, minimum!": "",
  "Miyamoto-san. You never told me you'd be using the photo to blackmail your harasser.": "",
  "Y-Yagami-san?": "",
  "You made me get you evidence of sexual harassment all to avoid getting transferred?": "",
  "And it was all too easy to manipulate this uber goober of a boss right into your hands, wasn't it?": "",
  "...Yagami-san. Your job is done, isn't it?": "",
  "It's over when I say it is. And I say if you're going to use those pictures for blackmail, you don't get to keep them.": "",
  "I'm not going to be an accessory to a crime.": "",
  "Rei-chan, can I knock this guy's teeth out?": "",
  "You'll go out with me if I do, right!?": "",
  "I suppose. But just a date. And you'll be lucky if I let you hold my hand.": "",
  "I'll take those odds! Sorry, buddy!": "",
  "I deleted the photo. And I don't need your money.": "",
  "Damn it! I was so close!": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Welcome.": "ยินดีต้อนรับ",
  "Get out!": "ออกไป!",
  "Get out of here right now!": "ออกไปเดี๋ยวนี้เลย!",
  "Oh, leaving already? Come back soon.": "อ้าว จะไปแล้วเหรอคะ แวะมาใหม่นะคะ",
  "Thank you very much! Come back again!": "ขอบคุณมากค่ะ! แวะมาใหม่นะคะ!",
  "Welcome!": "ยินดีต้อนรับ!",
  "Get out! Please leave!": "ออกไป! กรุณาออกไปด้วยค่ะ!",
  "Please leave!": "กรุณาออกไปด้วยค่ะ!",
  "Get out! And don't ever come back!": "ออกไป! แล้วอย่ากลับมาอีกเด็ดขาด!",
